      "claim": "JNJ-55511118, a lipophilic halogenated fused heteroaromatic lactam, was highly brain-penetrant with high target occupancy after oral dosing in rats and mice, directly supporting meaningful CNS access for the similarly lipophilic halogenated fused heteroaromatic query.",
